flowchart TB
    subgraph CLIENTS[Client channels]
        WEB[Web application<br/>Next.js]
        MOBILE[Mobile application<br/>Flutter]
        API[Authorized API clients]
    end

    subgraph EDGE[Access and service coordination]
        GATEWAY[API Gateway<br/>JWT validation, route authorization,<br/>correlation and rate controls]
        EUREKA[Eureka Discovery<br/>service registration and lookup]
    end

    subgraph SERVICES[Ten bounded contexts with isolated data ownership]
        direction TB
        REST[Versioned REST APIs<br/>default-deny endpoint authorization]
        CARE[Care delivery contexts<br/>Patient, Clinical, Lab, Inpatient and Surgery]
        OPERATIONS[Operational contexts<br/>Organization, Pharmacy, Billing,<br/>Notification and Report]
        DATA[Ten owned PostgreSQL databases<br/>one per service, no cross-service access]
        REST --> CARE
        REST --> OPERATIONS
        CARE --> DATA
        OPERATIONS --> DATA
    end

    subgraph INTEGRATION[Integration backbone]
        EVENTS[RabbitMQ topic exchange<br/>durable queues, retries and DLQs]
        CONTRACTS[Versioned event contracts<br/>transactional outbox and idempotent receipts]
    end

    subgraph CONTROLS[Cross-cutting controls]
        SECURITY[Security<br/>RBAC, ownership checks and default deny]
        OBS[Observability<br/>health, logs and correlation IDs]
        QUALITY[Quality gates<br/>unit, web, persistence and integration tests]
    end

    WEB -->|HTTPS /api/v1| GATEWAY
    MOBILE -->|HTTPS /api/v1| GATEWAY
    API -->|HTTPS /api/v1| GATEWAY
    GATEWAY -.->|service lookup| EUREKA
    GATEWAY --> REST
    REST -.->|register and discover| EUREKA
    CARE <-->|integration events| CONTRACTS
    OPERATIONS <-->|integration events| CONTRACTS
    CONTRACTS <--> EVENTS

    SECURITY -.-> GATEWAY
    SECURITY -.-> REST
    OBS -.-> GATEWAY
    OBS -.-> REST
    QUALITY -.-> REST
